{"bendscript":"0.1","blocks":[{"id":"blk-41874","kind":"heading","level":1,"spans":[{"id":"spn-46470","text":"Graphonomous MCP — Agent Skills"}]},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-41876","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-46471","marks":["bold"],"text":"Purpose:"},{"id":"spn-46472","text":" Teach any LLM connected to Graphonomous how to use its MCP machines correctly, idiomatically, and in the right sequence. These reference docs mirror the skills in the "},{"id":"spn-46473","marks":[{"kind":"link","predicate":"cites","target":"https://github.com/c-u-l8er/ampersand-plugins"}],"text":"ampersand-plugins"},{"id":"spn-46474","text":" Claude Code plugin. For Claude Code users, install the plugin directly: "},{"id":"spn-46475","marks":["code"],"text":"claude plugin add c-u-l8er/ampersand-plugins"}]}],"id":"blk-41875","kind":"quote"},{"id":"blk-41877","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-46476","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-41878","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-46477","text":"Quick Orientation"}]},{"id":"blk-41879","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-46478","text":"Graphonomous is a "},{"id":"spn-46479","marks":["bold"],"text":"continual learning engine"},{"id":"spn-46480","text":" exposed as 5 MCP machines. It maintains a "},{"id":"spn-46481","marks":["bold"],"text":"self-evolving knowledge graph"},{"id":"spn-46482","text":" of semantic, procedural, episodic, temporal, outcome, and goal nodes connected by typed, weighted edges. Your job as an LLM agent is to "},{"id":"spn-46483","marks":["bold"],"text":"read from and write to this graph"},{"id":"spn-46484","text":" as you work, creating a durable memory that improves over time."}]},{"id":"blk-41880","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-46485","text":"The Core Loop"}]},{"id":"blk-41881","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-46486","text":"Every interaction should follow this rhythm:"}]},{"id":"blk-41882","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"retrieve → route → act → learn → consolidate\n\"What do I k